Rrrrr {\n            font: italic 40px serif;\n            fill: red;\n        }\n    </style>\n</g>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for right triangle upper A upper B upper C\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>Angle upper A upper C upper B is a right angle.</li>\n<li>The length of side upper A upper B is 42.</li>\n<li>The length of side upper A upper C is 41.</li>\n<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"cosine upper A\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi></math> in the triangle shown?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"3b1b4bd4-96fc-46d4-bfbc-aabc9bafe427","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 42 Over 41 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"08e9e2fd-ae36-43b9-8187-21df215e6c58","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 41 Over 42 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"59f9b6bf-10af-4fae-89af-456c726f4af4","content":"<p><math alttext=\"one forty second\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"271dba0f-a063-4dd2-8d7c-17f4e05527ed","content":"<p><math alttext=\"one forty first\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"}],"keys":["08e9e2fd-ae36-43b9-8187-21df215e6c58"],"correct_answer":["B"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. The cosine of an acute angle in a right triangle is defined as the ratio of the length of the leg adjacent to the angle to the length of the hypotenuse. In the triangle shown, the length of the leg adjacent to angle <math alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"41\"><mn>41</mn>\n</math>, and the length of the hypotenuse is <math alttext=\"42\"><mn>42</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"cosine upper A equals StartFraction 41 Over 42 EndFraction\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>41</mn><mn>42</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 1 Over cosine upper A EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1730147357408,"pPcc":"SAT#S","questionId":"2bddbc1b","skill_cd":"S.C.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","createDate":1730147357408,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Geometry and Trigonometry","ibn":"","external_id":"8d9a8a64-b22e-4435-a19b-1ac97f998d7a","primary_class_cd":"S","uId":"2d25f713-8136-43f9-b03a-8a9c5c66f9d1","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"answerOptions":[{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 42 Over 41 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>","id":"3b1b4bd4-96fc-46d4-bfbc-aabc9bafe427"},{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 41 Over 42 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>","id":"08e9e2fd-ae36-43b9-8187-21df215e6c58"},{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"one forty second\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>","id":"59f9b6bf-10af-4fae-89af-456c726f4af4"},{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"one forty first\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>","id":"271dba0f-a063-4dd2-8d7c-17f4e05527ed"}],"externalid":"8d9a8a64-b22e-4435-a19b-1ac97f998d7a","keys":["08e9e2fd-ae36-43b9-8187-21df215e6c58"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. The cosine of an acute angle in a right triangle is defined as the ratio of the length of the leg adjacent to the angle to the length of the hypotenuse. In the triangle shown, the length of the leg adjacent to angle <math alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"41\"><mn>41</mn>\n</math>, and the length of the hypotenuse is <math alttext=\"42\"><mn>42</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"cosine upper A equals StartFraction 41 Over 42 EndFraction\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>41</mn><mn>42</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 1 Over cosine upper A EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Right triangle upper A upper B upper C. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 200.239875  L 244.8 200.239875  L 244.8 -0  L 0 -0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $41$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 47.296875 16.703125  L 37 16.703125  L 37 0  L 29.203125 0  L 29.203125 16.703125  L 1.203125 16.703125  L 1.203125 23.09375  L 32.59375 67.59375  L 37 67.59375  L 37 