/www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="angle upper S"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>S</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="135 degree"><mn>135</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>. Therefore, the measure of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="angle upper Z"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="135 degree"><mn>135</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
