    ($SATQ$33e29881$SATQ$, $SATQ$19da9e4a-267f-405a-bab5-768d4d5c4c29$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$3532bbeb-7705-4584-aa08-428792c5908b$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Right triangles and trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p>In right triangle <math alttext="upper R upper S upper T"><mrow>
	<mi>R</mi>
	<mi>S</mi>
	<mi>T</mi>
</mrow>
</math>, the sum of the measures of angle <math alttext="upper R"><mi>R</mi>
</math> and angle <math alttext="upper S"><mi>S</mi>
</math> is <math alttext="90"><mn>90</mn>
</math> degrees. The value of <math alttext="sine left parenthesis upper R right parenthesis"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced></math> is <math alttext="StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction"><mrow>
	<mfrac>
		<msqrt>
			<mn>15</mn>
		</msqrt>
		<mn>4</mn>
	</mfrac>
</mrow>
</math>. What is the value of <math alttext="cosine left parenthesis upper S right parenthesis"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"33974f5d-cad7-43c8-88e7-961f0eb2046e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 15 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7a86b843-9922-4a4b-837c-e5a66c1d70c5","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"6563606d-7a9e-4b20-8935-c9203fc07001","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 4 StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 15 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"812f40a9-70d1-4cf2-810a-57844848ee8e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartRoot 15 EndRoot\"><msqrt>\n\t<mn>15</mn>\n</msqrt>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["7a86b843-9922-4a4b-837c-e5a66c1d70c5"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice B is correct. The sine of any acute angle is equal to the cosine of its complement. It&rsquo;s given that in right triangle <math alttext="upper R upper S upper T"><mrow>
	<mi>R</mi>
	<mi>S</mi>
	<mi>T</mi>
</mrow>
</math>, the sum of the measures of angle <math alttext="upper R"><mi>R</mi>
</math> and angle <math alttext="upper S"><mi>S</mi>
</math> is <math alttext="90"><mn>90</mn>
</math> degrees. Therefore, angle <math alttext="upper R"><mi>R</mi>
</math> and angle <math alttext="upper S"><mi>S</mi>
</math> are complementary, and the value of <math alttext="sine upper R"><mi>sin</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is equal to the value of <math alttext="cosine upper S"><mi>cos</mi><mi>S</mi></math>. It's given that the value of <math alttext="sine upper R"><mi>sin</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is <math alttext="StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, so the value of&nbsp;<math alttext="cosine upper S"><mi>cos</mi><mi>S</mi></math> is also <math alttext="StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="tangent upper S"><mi>tan</mi><mi>S</mi></math>.</p>
<p>Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="StartFraction 1 Over cosine upper S EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>
<p>Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="StartFraction 1 Over tangent upper S EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$manifold$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"33e29881","external_id":"19da9e4a-267f-405a-bab5-768d4d5c4c29","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":"3532bbeb-7705-4584-aa08-428792c5908b","uId":"0cb116a1-df55-4959-878c-cfbff26e1227","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":5,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p>In right triangle <math alttext=\"upper R upper S upper T\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>R</mi>\n\t<mi>S</mi>\n\t<mi>T</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the sum of the measures of angle <math alttext=\"upper R\"><mi>R</mi>\n</math> and angle <math alttext=\"upper S\"><mi>S</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math> degrees. The value of <math alttext=\"sine left parenthesis upper R right parenthesis\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"cosine left parenthesis upper S right parenthesis\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced></math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"33974f5d-cad7-43c8-88e7-961f0eb2046e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 15 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7a86b843-9922-4a4b-837c-e5a66c1d70c5","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction StartRoot 15 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n